 128, else 4 rows per thread).

## Recipes

`recipes/qwen3_5.toml` (dense FFN):

```toml
[config]
name = "Qwen3.5 32B"
model_type = "qwen3_5"
layer_types = ["gdn", "moe"]
```

`recipes/qwen3_5_moe.toml` (MoE FFN):

```toml
[config]
name = "Qwen3.5 32B MoE"
model_type = "qwen3_5_moe"
layer_types = ["gdn", "moe"]
```

## Testing

`cargo test --test test_gdn` (f64 reference, f32 CUDA, f16 CUDA).

## Notes

* GatedDeltaNet is a gated state-space model (SSM) with a delta-rule update. The kernel is a causal depthwise conv
  (K=4, C=8192) followed by the delta-rule. The conv state is `[C, K-1]` (f32), the delta-rule state is `[Hv,
